# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# job-finder — OPTIONAL discovery keys (BYO). Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# IMPORTANT: There is NO scoring API key here, by design. Scoring runs through
# whatever AI CLI you already have, not through a key this app holds.
#
# The default discovery channel (public ATS scan) needs NONE of these keys —
# it is free and runs out of the box. The keys below only enable extra,
# opt-in discovery channels. Each is YOUR own account; you bear its cost/ToS.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Layer 2 — Google Jobs (indirect LinkedIn/board coverage via Google's index).
# Get one free key at https://serpapi.com (or Serper.dev). Optional.
# SERPAPI_KEY=
# SERPER_API_KEY=

# Layer 3 — Apify BYO-token: Naukri + LinkedIn + Indeed (the India-native boards
# ATS/Google miss). Cookieless actors hit each platform's PUBLIC guest API — no
# login, no account-ban risk. Free $5/mo credit, no card: https://apify.com.
# Off unless this token is set. You bring the token; runs bill to YOUR Apify
# account; you accept each board's ToS directly. Sent only as Authorization:
# Bearer to api.apify.com — never logged, never persisted.
# Which platforms run is configurable in config/profile.yml (discovery.apify.platforms);
# default when a token is present: naukri, linkedin, indeed.
# APIFY_TOKEN=
